>           (1-r_x)/w, log(H/W)] cast to the weight's dtype (bf16), the add = index_add in the input's dtype (the trainer's op order).
>           SLOT = P - 1 = the system block's last position ('\\n' of the footer <|im_end|> \\n on channel B, no codes, no pose; asserted), inside
>           the prefill (pose6 decision D1 / D2: the position just before conversation frame 0 = the 8,1,1 rows' [SLOT 1 | clip | GAP 4] SLOT,
